  "goodToKnow": "Der Pfeil is an arrow: Pfeil und Bogen (bow and arrow), einem Pfeil folgen (follow an arrow sign). On keyboards, die Pfeiltasten are the arrow keys. Pronounce both sounds of pf: PFAIL. The word comes from Latin pilum (javelin). Pfeilschnell means as fast as an arrow. In Amor's Pfeil, love strikes like an arrow. In darts, the small arrows are called Darts or Pfeile. Plural: die Pfeile."
